{"unit_id":"danieldu168__dsh-stash#card-zh","repo":"danieldu168/dsh-stash","commit":"b15334f235528bd95b9053129ae4a1dda70e6c74","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-stash 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的外部数据源管理插件。它注册 Model Tools，并提供 /stash 命令和设置面板，让人登记 API、数据库、本地文件及 MCP 资源。模型可查看资源目录、按声明动作取数、搜索本地语料并查询取数台账，也能记录按数据源整理的经验。配置中的 access 边界会限制取数，凭据通过宿主 credentials 服务按引用名解析；台账保存取数指纹而非响应正文。适合需要在多个 DSH 会话中复用外部资料，并追踪数据来源的用户；资源登记与凭据配置需按各数据源填写。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:30-75","lib/tools.js:134-146","lib/tools.js:337-348","lib/ledger.js:1-22"]}
{"unit_id":"danieldu168__dsh-stash#card-en","repo":"danieldu168/dsh-stash","commit":"b15334f235528bd95b9053129ae4a1dda70e6c74","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-stash manages external sources in DSH Web. Its tools and settings panel catalog APIs, databases, local files, and MCP resources; fetch declared actions; search corpora; and review fetch fingerprints. It suits users who reuse research sources and track provenance.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:30-75","lib/tools.js:134-146","lib/tools.js:337-348","lib/ledger.js:1-22"]}
{"unit_id":"danieldu168__dsh-stash#intent-1","repo":"danieldu168/dsh-stash","commit":"b15334f235528bd95b9053129ae4a1dda70e6c74","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"想让 DSH 按我登记的 API 动作查外部数据，并保留这次取数的来源记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:337-348","lib/ledger.js:1-22"]}
