{"unit_id":"danieldu168__dsh-stash#feature-1","repo":"danieldu168/dsh-stash","commit":"b15334f235528bd95b9053129ae4a1dda70e6c74","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-stash 的「资源目录」功能：列出已登记资源及其动作、覆盖范围和凭据就绪信息。模型调用 stash_catalog，可传资源 id 查看单项详情，取数前据此选择资源与动作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:139-146"]}
{"unit_id":"danieldu168__dsh-stash#feature-2","repo":"danieldu168/dsh-stash","commit":"b15334f235528bd95b9053129ae4a1dda70e6c74","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-stash 的「按声明动作取数」功能：通过 stash_fetch 使用资源 id、动作名和参数获取数据，并返回台账 id。声明为仅人工导入或不支持的资源会按使用边界拒绝自动取数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:337-357"]}
{"unit_id":"danieldu168__dsh-stash#feature-3","repo":"danieldu168/dsh-stash","commit":"b15334f235528bd95b9053129ae4a1dda70e6c74","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-stash 的「本地语料查找」功能：列出登记的本机文件与目录；提供 contains 时可在文本文件中做不区分大小写的子串搜索并返回命中行。找到路径后由 DSH 的 read 工具读取内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:494-506"]}
{"unit_id":"danieldu168__dsh-stash#feature-4","repo":"danieldu168/dsh-stash","commit":"b15334f235528bd95b9053129ae4a1dda70e6c74","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-stash 的「取数台账」功能：按资源查看过往取数的时间、状态、大小及指纹，可筛选失败记录。台账用于追溯取数事件，不包含响应正文。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:622-637","lib/ledger.js:1-22"]}
{"unit_id":"danieldu168__dsh-stash#feature-5","repo":"danieldu168/dsh-stash","commit":"b15334f235528bd95b9053129ae4a1dda70e6c74","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-stash 的「相关资源提示」功能：在 agent 每步开始前读取用户消息并匹配已登记资源，只在有相关资源时注入清单线索，帮助模型选择对应数据源。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/prompt.js:90-131","lib/prompt.js:178-190"]}
{"unit_id":"danieldu168__dsh-stash#caveat-1","repo":"danieldu168/dsh-stash","commit":"b15334f235528bd95b9053129ae4a1dda70e6c74","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-stash 使用 DSH_HOME 指定数据根目录；未设置时落在用户主目录的 .dsh 下，并在其中保存资源注册表、缓存、语料和台账。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/home.js:17-27"]}
